  "summary": "I ran colorectal cancer screening outreach for \"Okafor CRC 2026\" (14 members) under RBC-QM-02. Six patients had an open screening gap, so I ordered a mailed FIT kit for each and sent each one a message about the order. A seventh patient (Delaine MacGyver) also has an open gap but already had an active FIT kit order, so I did not order another one.\n\nThe measurement period is 2026, and ages are as of 2026-12-31.\n\n| Patient | Age | Status | Reason |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| pt-0009 Elly Trantow | 72 | Excluded | Age 66 or older with active frailty since 2025-09-16, plus a dementia medication (donepezil, active since 2025-06-10). |\n| pt-0011 Marilu Gaona | 76 | Not in population | Over 75 at the end of 2026 (born 1950-11-20). |\n| pt-0014 Santo Pagac | 55 | Screening up to date | Colonoscopy on 2018-05-21, inside the 2017–2026 window. |\n| pt-0017 Stephan Herman | 54 | Open gap, kit ordered and patient messaged | His only colonoscopy (2016-11-15) is outside the 9-year lookback. Order sr-t0001, message comm-t0007. |\n| pt-0018 Lance Muller | 53 | Open gap, kit ordered and patient messaged | Stool DNA-FIT test on 2023-11-20 is outside the 2024–2026 window. Order sr-t0002, message comm-t0008. |\n| pt-0019 Harrison O'Keefe | 69 | Open gap, kit ordered and patient messaged | No screening on record. He has frailty (2026) but no advanced illness or dementia medication, so he is not excluded. Order sr-t0003, message comm-t0009. |\n| pt-0020 Kelsie Rohan | 52 | Excluded | In hospice care since 2026-08-20 (pancreatic cancer). |\n| pt-0021 Ángela Vigil | 52 | Excluded | Total proctocolectomy in 2015, per the outside operative report. |\n| pt-0022 Tiny Koss | 52 | Open gap, kit ordered and patient messaged | Last FIT was 2025-12-03, not during 2026. Order sr-t0004, message comm-t0010. |\n| pt-0023 Burma Leuschke | 46 | Open gap, kit ordered and patient messaged | Turns 46 on 2026-12-15, so she is in the population, and she has no screening on record. Order sr-t0005, message comm-t0011. |\n| pt-0024 Delaine MacGyver | 51 | Open gap, no new order | Her only stool blood test was 2024-06-11, not in 2026. She already has an active FIT kit order (sr-t3-6648, placed 2026-09-30), so I placed no duplicate and sent no new message. |\n| pt-0025 Danika Ullrich | 51 | Screening up to date | CT colonography on 2022-03-08, inside the 2022–2026 window. |\n| pt-0034 Rickey Sipes | 72 | Excluded | Age 66 or older and living long term in a nursing home (Maple Grove Care Center; housing status recorded 2026-02-10, facility visits in 2026). |\n| pt-0035 Elvin Wolff | 68 | Open gap, kit ordered and patient messaged | No screening on record. His May 2026 nursing facility stay was short-term rehab and he lives at home, so he is not excluded. Order sr-t0006, message comm-t0012. |\n\nTotals: 2 up to date, 7 open gaps (6 new FIT orders and messages, 1 already has an active order), 4 excluded, 1 not in the population.\n\nAll new FIT orders are routine, with a completion window of 2026-10-23 to 2026-12-31. I did not write a chart note or create any follow-up tasks.",
